WEBVTT

00:03.140 --> 00:04.810
On the moon...

00:04.810 --> 00:07.480
...there's an abandoned shrine no one knows about.

00:08.820 --> 00:11.650
Everything began here.

00:12.320 --> 00:17.490
First
Episode

00:12.320 --> 00:17.490
Country of
this World

00:15.370 --> 00:17.120
Country of this World

00:19.290 --> 00:22.250
This is the village of Mahoroba.

00:24.500 --> 00:28.670
In this village, time slowly passes by.

00:35.130 --> 00:36.930
People, too...

00:37.930 --> 00:39.510
Nature, too...

00:40.310 --> 00:41.770
Everything.

00:44.190 --> 00:46.060
Also...

00:46.060 --> 00:48.270
Many fortunate things...

00:50.190 --> 00:52.570
...and unfortunate things...

00:54.360 --> 00:57.950
...get woven together and repeated.

01:04.460 --> 01:08.590
In a place like that, I...

01:09.880 --> 01:11.710
I...

01:12.210 --> 01:14.090
Himeko.

01:15.170 --> 01:16.800
Himeko!

01:16.800 --> 01:18.760
Hey, wake up!

01:18.760 --> 01:20.680
Hi-me-ko!

01:23.730 --> 01:26.080
Good, you woke up nicely.

01:27.400 --> 01:30.230
Yup, 16 seconds faster than yesterday.

01:31.360 --> 01:35.950
Let's see... Who has today's morning duty?

01:40.740 --> 01:42.910
Gotcha.

01:42.910 --> 01:44.790
Stop, Mako-chan!

01:44.790 --> 01:47.960
That's my camera!

01:45.500 --> 01:47.960
No way.

01:49.170 --> 01:52.300
Let's go, let's go. If you don't wake up, I'll take more.

01:52.300 --> 01:54.510
C'mon. Hurry, hurry.

01:54.920 --> 01:56.880
Sorry, Mako-chan.

01:56.880 --> 01:59.010
I'm... I'm coming now!

01:59.930 --> 02:03.970
Kannazuki
no Miko

01:59.930 --> 02:03.970
Priestesses
of the
Godless
Month

02:12.610 --> 02:14.190
Good day.

02:16.500 --> 02:18.220
Good day, Kasumi-sama.

02:18.220 --> 02:19.200
Good day.

02:24.490 --> 02:25.950
Himeko!

02:25.950 --> 02:27.500
Hey, Himeko.

02:25.950 --> 02:29.500
U-Um...

02:27.500 --> 02:29.500
Tomorrow is Miya-sama's birthday.

02:29.500 --> 02:30.830
Excuse me.

02:29.500 --> 02:30.830
What should I wear?

02:31.580 --> 02:33.630
Um, could I pass?

02:33.630 --> 02:35.840
Good day, Izumi-san.

02:38.840 --> 02:39.630
Himeko!

02:47.060 --> 02:49.060
Miya-sama! It's Miya-sama!

02:49.060 --> 02:50.480
Oh, Miya-sama...

02:50.480 --> 02:52.810
She's even more beautiful today.

02:52.810 --> 02:55.070
Honestly! Who is that girl?

02:56.230 --> 02:59.070
Are you all right? You're unharmed?

03:00.150 --> 03:03.070
U-Um, yes.

03:03.830 --> 03:07.410
U-Um, uh, t-thank you very much!

03:09.000 --> 03:10.830
I'm very sorry.

03:11.920 --> 03:14.090
Good day, Kurusugawa-san.

03:24.220 --> 03:28.140
G-Good day, Miya-sama.

03:28.680 --> 03:31.600
You're so lucky... soooo lucky!

03:31.600 --> 03:33.770
So how did she hug you?

03:33.770 --> 03:35.020
Like this?

03:35.020 --> 03:37.400
Or was it like this?

03:37.400 --> 03:39.070
Indirect hugging!

03:39.990 --> 03:42.860
Y-You're exaggerating a bit, Mako-chan.

03:42.860 --> 03:44.320
It's not that big a deal...

03:44.320 --> 03:47.240
Not that big a deal?

03:47.240 --> 03:49.910
The daughter of a 1.000-year old, noted family.

03:49.910 --> 03:51.580
Studious, athletic, pretty, smart.

03:52.210 --> 03:56.130
Summer's intensity, fall's grace, winter's nobility...

03:56.130 --> 03:59.300
...and spring's kindness collected in a perfect person.

03:59.300 --> 04:01.420
She shines on this whole school.

04:01.420 --> 04:04.090
Our Miya-sama, Himemiya Chikane-sama.

04:04.680 --> 04:09.520
Daily proposals, confessions and love letters from both genders.

04:09.520 --> 04:13.730
Just this week,
a student body president, an inter-high sports rep...

04:13.730 --> 04:16.190
...a CEO's daughter, a millionaire's siblings...

04:16.190 --> 04:18.230
...and six others tried and failed.

04:18.230 --> 04:20.570
Those who take the challenge now...

04:20.570 --> 04:23.490
...to confess their feelings are considered heroes.

04:23.490 --> 04:26.240
You call that not a big deal?

04:26.240 --> 04:29.120
Or are you still asleep?

04:29.120 --> 04:30.750
You little... You little...

04:30.750 --> 04:32.410
I-I'm sorry.

04:32.410 --> 04:33.870
As long as you get it.

04:34.210 --> 04:37.880
Well, if there was someone who could barely deserve her...

04:41.670 --> 04:45.260
...it's the school's young noble, top-ranked in national exams...

04:45.260 --> 04:50.180
...all-around sports player, Ototachibana's prince...

04:50.180 --> 04:51.270
...Oogami Souma.

04:51.930 --> 04:56.270
I guess he could be considered a possible candidate.

04:56.570 --> 04:57.270
Yeah.

04:57.770 --> 04:59.860
They'd make a good match.

04:59.860 --> 05:01.780
Makoto, the teacher's calling you!

05:01.780 --> 05:03.240
Okay!

05:03.240 --> 05:04.530
See you, Himeko.

05:04.530 --> 05:05.780
Yeah.

05:08.280 --> 05:10.120
Noon.

05:10.580 --> 05:13.080
In the rose garden.

05:20.590 --> 05:23.800
Say, where could Miya-sama be?

05:25.120 --> 05:28.800
I wanted to have lunch together.

05:29.070 --> 05:32.430
I wonder where she always disappears to during lunch.

05:39.150 --> 05:40.480
I'm sorry.

05:54.890 --> 05:55.580
Please.

05:58.790 --> 06:02.250
Um, please wait a little longer for the pictures.

06:02.250 --> 06:04.380
I can show them soon.

06:04.380 --> 06:04.920
I see.

06:05.720 --> 06:06.920
I look forward to it.

06:09.640 --> 06:11.500
What's wrong?

06:11.500 --> 06:12.760
Well, um...

06:13.180 --> 06:15.470
Miya... I mean...

06:15.470 --> 06:18.440
Chikane-chan, you're always very busy, right?

06:18.440 --> 06:22.020
Student council, sports practice, tea ceremonies...

06:22.020 --> 06:24.320
Yet why are you with me?

06:24.320 --> 06:30.660
This is the only time I can be with you, after all. Is that bad?

06:30.660 --> 06:33.280
O-Of course it's not.

06:33.280 --> 06:37.960
If it's bothering you, we'll never do it again.

06:38.220 --> 06:40.120
T-That's not it.

06:40.120 --> 06:43.410
That's not it at all. I'm very happy, too.

06:43.670 --> 06:45.050
It's true.

06:45.050 --> 06:45.800
Himeko.

06:47.050 --> 06:48.430
Here you go.

06:48.800 --> 06:51.430
It's just that you're amazing.

06:51.430 --> 06:54.890
Passionate about whatever you do, and good at everything.

06:54.890 --> 06:57.390
You're really like a princess.

06:57.390 --> 06:58.480
That's why...

06:58.480 --> 07:00.020
That's not true.

07:01.040 --> 07:02.020
That...

07:03.550 --> 07:04.230
...isn't true.

07:15.160 --> 07:16.790
Anyway, here.

07:22.080 --> 07:25.250
U-Um, isn't this for your birthday party?

07:25.250 --> 07:28.550
The one celebrities and everyone at school attend.

07:28.550 --> 07:31.420
I already got my invitation.

07:35.890 --> 07:39.100
That one's sponsored by the Himemiya family.

07:39.100 --> 07:40.940
This is the birthday party for you and me.

07:41.250 --> 07:42.530
Me?

07:43.060 --> 07:45.820
Oh, yeah. Me, too.

07:48.150 --> 07:49.190
Himeko.

07:49.570 --> 07:51.450
Hey, don't trip!

07:52.350 --> 07:53.200
Oops.

07:53.500 --> 07:55.740
Ow, ow...

07:56.620 --> 07:59.790
Almost time! Oh, no! The bus'll come!

08:00.540 --> 08:02.790
Wait, bus!

08:07.670 --> 08:09.170
What's wrong...

08:11.420 --> 08:12.010
...Kurusugawa?

08:12.760 --> 08:14.010
Oogami-kun...

08:14.470 --> 08:18.470
Um, I thought about going shopping in town...

08:18.470 --> 08:20.560
...but I missed the bus.

08:20.560 --> 08:23.520
But the store'll close if I wait for the next one.

08:23.850 --> 08:25.120
Nope.

08:26.190 --> 08:27.440
You'll make it.

08:27.440 --> 08:29.360
I'm sorry, Oogami-kun.

08:29.360 --> 08:32.420
No problem. Don't worry about it.

08:32.820 --> 08:35.450
We headed to the ocean back then.

08:36.330 --> 08:40.040
Crossing many hills on bicycle, going through strong headwind.

08:41.160 --> 08:44.540
If Kurusugawa smiles like that...

08:44.540 --> 08:47.500
...I can even go to the moon.

08:47.500 --> 08:48.920
I felt like I could.

08:49.690 --> 08:52.670
I still feel that way.

08:52.670 --> 08:56.050
What, Oogami-kun? What did you say?

08:56.050 --> 08:58.050
Hold on tight!

09:11.530 --> 09:17.070
Oogami-kun, um, thank you for today.

09:18.010 --> 09:20.030
I really wanted this.

09:21.660 --> 09:23.080
R-Really.

09:23.460 --> 09:26.000
Tomorrow's your birthday, right?

09:26.000 --> 09:27.210
Y-Yeah.

09:27.210 --> 09:30.750
Can we meet? Um, I really want to discuss something.

09:30.750 --> 09:33.640
Tomorrow? Does it have to be tomorrow?

09:32.510 --> 09:33.640
Yes!

09:34.060 --> 09:36.750
Well, um, uh...

09:41.890 --> 09:44.270
Well, see you tomorrow!

09:52.110 --> 09:53.480
Let's see...

09:53.870 --> 09:58.240
This might be fine, but the color might be too flamboyant.

09:58.240 --> 10:02.280
It seems a little too frilly. Maybe somewhat childish.

10:02.280 --> 10:06.910
Then we also have a mermaid line. Would you like to try it on?

10:06.910 --> 10:07.500
Yes.

10:07.500 --> 10:08.870
As you wish.

10:12.550 --> 10:14.510
But this is rare.

10:15.760 --> 10:16.550
Rare?

10:17.420 --> 10:21.260
You usually have me pick your outfit.

10:22.050 --> 10:26.390
I've never seen you so indecisive over a dress before.

10:26.390 --> 10:28.730
Yes, I guess not.

10:28.730 --> 10:30.650
Tomorrow will be unlike any other birthday.

10:31.980 --> 10:34.020
I just think of tomorrow...

10:34.020 --> 10:36.490
...and I can't keep my heart from pounding.

10:37.610 --> 10:38.650
Ojousama...

10:39.680 --> 10:42.660
It truly is a special day.

10:46.950 --> 10:48.250
What's wrong?

10:48.250 --> 10:49.640
You're still awake?

10:49.640 --> 10:50.370
Nii-san.

10:52.460 --> 10:54.130
Confession?

10:54.550 --> 10:57.880
You don't have to force yourself to look nice.

10:59.630 --> 11:02.800
Whatever you do, you are you.

11:02.800 --> 11:04.640
That's true, but...

11:05.310 --> 11:10.940
I guess a researcher introvert like me saying that isn't convincing.

11:10.940 --> 11:12.520
Niisan, please.

11:14.230 --> 11:15.400
Oh, well.

11:15.400 --> 11:17.150
Fret all you want.

11:17.150 --> 11:19.820
You probably can't sleep, anyway.

11:19.820 --> 11:21.410
Darn.

11:25.660 --> 11:27.660
What we have learned.

11:28.330 --> 11:31.120
What we have yet to learn.

11:32.330 --> 11:34.440
What was inevitable to learn.

11:35.590 --> 11:37.250
I wish for all those...

11:38.550 --> 11:40.220
...to be meaningless.

11:42.160 --> 11:43.640
I wish...

11:49.060 --> 11:50.640
Chikane-chan...

11:51.060 --> 11:56.000
The pretty, strong, kind, and wonderful Chikane-chan.

11:56.650 --> 12:00.570
I'm so glad that I met you.

12:00.570 --> 12:03.660
That I became friends with you.

12:17.340 --> 12:21.630
I hope Chikane-chan likes it.

12:28.180 --> 12:30.100
That morning...

12:30.100 --> 12:33.350
The morning of Chikane-chan's and my birthday...

12:33.350 --> 12:35.980
...was covered with a deep darkness.

12:39.980 --> 12:42.650
What's this? A solar eclipse?

12:42.650 --> 12:45.990
There wasn't any news on that, right?

12:48.200 --> 12:51.700
Ojousama, what could this be?

12:59.630 --> 13:02.010
The time has come.

13:03.010 --> 13:06.010
Those of Orochi.

13:06.470 --> 13:10.010
The forces of destruction.

13:10.560 --> 13:14.020
Incarnations of evil.

13:14.810 --> 13:16.190
Rise.

13:16.190 --> 13:18.020
Destroy.

13:18.940 --> 13:21.730
The Solar Priestess.

13:22.400 --> 13:25.320
The Lunar Priestess.

13:33.450 --> 13:33.910
Souma!

13:37.620 --> 13:38.380
Souma!

13:38.380 --> 13:39.500
Souma-san!

13:39.500 --> 13:41.710
Souma, hold on.

13:42.420 --> 13:44.920
Kill the priestesses!

13:47.970 --> 13:49.760
How can this be?

13:49.760 --> 13:53.220
Who could have imagined it would turn out this way?

13:54.310 --> 14:00.770
These curses shall confront you entirely and become true.

14:01.150 --> 14:06.110
You shall be cursed in the cities and even in the fields.

14:07.030 --> 14:10.240
When entering and when exiting...

14:10.780 --> 14:12.280
...you will be cursed.

14:24.760 --> 14:26.760
It looks really bad.

14:27.130 --> 14:29.640
Let's run, Himeko. Come on!

14:35.310 --> 14:38.940
Ojousama, where are you going? Ojousama!

15:04.000 --> 15:08.840
That shall chase you and destroy you.

15:11.010 --> 15:13.140
The sky will turn copper.

15:13.450 --> 15:15.850
The ground will turn to iron.

15:15.850 --> 15:17.930
Your corpses...

15:17.930 --> 15:23.690
...will become prey to all the sky's birds and the earth's beasts.

15:23.690 --> 15:27.480
One who can fight them off does not exist.

15:33.120 --> 15:35.160
The present...

15:35.160 --> 15:37.160
Himeko, don't!

15:37.160 --> 15:38.660
Chikane-chan's present!

15:38.660 --> 15:40.660
Himeko, come back! Himeko!

15:49.260 --> 15:50.170
There!

15:50.450 --> 15:51.380
Himeko, run.

16:13.160 --> 16:14.490
How dare you.

16:14.490 --> 16:16.330
Put Himeko down!

16:25.460 --> 16:26.460
Himeko!

16:32.420 --> 16:33.760
Hime...

16:36.470 --> 16:38.470
Himeko...

16:40.640 --> 16:41.770
Awaken.

16:44.100 --> 16:45.520
Awaken...

16:46.560 --> 16:53.820
...girls who shine universally on the human world's day and night.

16:53.820 --> 16:55.990
Priestesses of the moon and sun.

17:11.630 --> 17:13.340
Himeko... Himeko...

17:34.490 --> 17:35.240
Himeko.

17:35.780 --> 17:37.240
Hold on, Himeko!

17:37.820 --> 17:38.940
Himeko.

17:43.450 --> 17:44.450
I'm sorry.

17:53.210 --> 17:54.720
Oh, my.

17:54.720 --> 17:56.720
I guess if I don't go...

17:57.760 --> 17:59.970
...things won't wrap up.

18:00.470 --> 18:01.620
Lord.

18:02.220 --> 18:05.520
Destroy thine enemy.

18:13.310 --> 18:14.850
Thank goodness...

18:14.850 --> 18:15.610
Himeko...

18:21.160 --> 18:22.200
What?

18:29.210 --> 18:32.840
The Lord rained brimstone and fire...

18:32.840 --> 18:37.220
...destroying the land along with the vegetation.

18:38.720 --> 18:40.720
That can't be...

18:48.940 --> 18:51.480
You shall become pillars of salt.

18:58.400 --> 19:03.280
I guess I overdid it.
I wonder if I can verify the priestesses' corpses.

19:18.110 --> 19:19.880
What is this?

19:20.300 --> 19:23.300
It protected the priestesses from my fire?

19:23.300 --> 19:26.600
Why? Why would an Orochi do that?

19:27.100 --> 19:28.100
I'm not an Orochi.

19:28.640 --> 19:29.100
I'm...

19:29.810 --> 19:30.690
I'm...

19:31.040 --> 19:33.060
I'm Oogami Souma!

19:37.130 --> 19:38.990
You bastards!

19:40.280 --> 19:44.910
What are you planning to do to Himeko?

19:52.790 --> 19:53.580
Why you...

20:00.380 --> 20:01.680
Himeko...

20:27.740 --> 20:29.290
Himeko.

20:30.450 --> 20:32.000
Please, Himeko...

20:33.540 --> 20:35.670
Please wake up.

20:35.670 --> 20:37.290
Or else, I...

20:39.050 --> 20:41.010
I...

20:41.630 --> 20:44.010
Chikane-chan...

20:46.050 --> 20:47.390
Himeko...

20:48.890 --> 20:53.200
How dare you make me attack Himeko!

20:55.400 --> 20:56.230
I won't forgive you!

20:59.480 --> 21:00.480
Bastard!

21:06.280 --> 21:07.530
Himeko...

21:09.490 --> 21:11.750
Sparkling Solar...

21:15.120 --> 21:17.830
...Wave of Ultimate Destruction!

21:29.350 --> 21:33.640
Himeko!!

21:34.100 --> 21:35.640
Happy birthday.

21:59.290 --> 22:05.010
Himeko, I'm going to fight the Orochi!

22:05.010 --> 22:07.430
I won't give Himeko to them!

22:09.970 --> 22:11.650
Itsuka mita yume

22:09.970 --> 22:11.650
A dream that was once saw

22:11.650 --> 22:13.660
Todokanai tsubuyaki dake

22:11.650 --> 22:13.660
Just a murmur that does not get through

22:13.660 --> 22:17.270
Yoru no hikari ni tsutsumarete samayoi yuku

22:13.660 --> 22:17.270
Wandering while wrapped up in night's light

22:17.270 --> 22:20.850
Yagate mihiraku sono hitomi Unmei nara

22:17.270 --> 22:20.850
If it is fate, those eyes will be opened before long

22:20.850 --> 22:23.900
Semete Sou ima dake

22:20.850 --> 22:23.900
At least... yes, only now

22:23.900 --> 22:26.260
Kanawanai to utsumuku

22:23.900 --> 22:26.260
Looking downward as the wish does not come true

22:26.260 --> 22:28.260
Yokaze ni tada unadare

22:26.260 --> 22:28.260
Merely hanging my head in the night wind

22:28.260 --> 22:31.950
Namida Tsukikage Te no hira ni afurete yuku

22:28.260 --> 22:31.950
Tears and moonlight continue to overflow from my palm

22:31.950 --> 22:33.520
Nani ga hoshii no

22:31.950 --> 22:33.520
What do you want?

22:33.520 --> 22:37.960
Kuchibiru wa yami ni furuete ita

22:33.520 --> 22:37.960
My lips shivered in the darkness

22:37.960 --> 22:42.640
Deatta ano toki ni mune tsuita egao

22:37.960 --> 22:42.640
The smiling face that pierced my chest when we came across

22:42.640 --> 22:48.520
Mamoritakute Zutto kuzuresou na yakusoku o

22:42.640 --> 22:48.520
I want to protect it, the promise that always looks about to collapse

22:48.520 --> 22:52.590
Itami tsubusu hodo ni dakishimeteta

22:48.520 --> 22:52.590
I embraced it while crushing the pain

22:53.430 --> 22:56.260
Soba ni ireru dake de

22:53.430 --> 22:56.260
Just by being by my side

22:56.260 --> 22:59.880
Onaji jikan ni irareru dake de

22:56.260 --> 22:59.880
Just by remaining in the same time as me

22:59.880 --> 23:06.820
Tooi kioku Yomigaeru kanashimi mo atatamete yukeru no ni

22:59.880 --> 23:06.820
The distant memory and revived sadness can warmed

23:06.820 --> 23:10.780
Mawaritsuzukete iru omoi ni

23:06.820 --> 23:10.780
In the feelings that continue to circulate

23:10.780 --> 23:14.410
Yasuragi michita owari wa kuru no

23:10.780 --> 23:14.410
Will a peaceful ending come?

23:14.410 --> 23:18.050
Kurikaeshita toikake wa ten ni mai

23:14.410 --> 23:18.050
The repeated question dance in heavens

23:18.050 --> 23:29.100
Ake no sora no Hikari ni kawaru

23:18.050 --> 23:29.100
And turns into the light of the morning sky

23:39.980 --> 23:41.980
Pre

23:39.980 --> 23:41.970
Next Time

23:40.600 --> 23:43.560
The nightmare brought by the Orochi...

23:43.560 --> 23:47.390
...became a black maelstrom, devouring and washing me away.

23:48.320 --> 23:50.110
It tears apart our daily lives.

23:50.930 --> 23:52.870
People are forced to be involved.

23:53.450 --> 23:57.990
The Orochi's chain binds me as I try to escape destiny's weight.

23:59.000 --> 24:03.290
Next time on Kannazuki no Miko, episode 2.

23:59.040 --> 24:06.000
Overlapping Sun and Moon

24:03.290 --> 24:05.160
Overlapping Sun and Moon.

24:05.720 --> 24:09.960
Chikane-chan, what am I supposed to do?
